			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> When IFT lands, we can serve the initial webfont with just the space character. It'll be a 300 byte WOFF2. People will marvel at how lean it is, and how fast it loads. PageSpeed score is 107%! The rest of the font, at 200KB, plops into place on a second round trip to the server, but no one notices.</p><p>(This started out as a joke and now I scared myself into thinking this is what folks are actually gonna do 🙀)</p>",
